VSH stdc function names and NID values come from aldostools/webMAN-MOD:
https://github.com/aldostools/webMAN-MOD/blob/6bd4425229544e60c5c8cfdcadb664dfb163d9f3/vsh/stdc.h
SHA-256: b0e6d68693ea2938fbcd8e6438b7a5c85a54ee9da7c0d1042196a3bf654c83b0
webMAN MOD is GPL-3.0 licensed. The installer reads factual name/NID mappings;
it does not compile or bundle webMAN implementation code. The custom VSH
smoke import uses the GetCooperationMode NID documented in vsh/vshmain.h.

